. This is file    spectral.dp
.  Create a GIF file for a spectral plot
.
DEVICE 1 X11
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE 
TITLE SIZE 4
TITLE DISPLACEMENT 2
LABEL CASES ASIS
TITLE CASES ASIS
LABEL SIZE 4
TIC LABEL SIZE 4
THICKNESS 0.2
.
PRE-ERASE OFF
.
skip 25
read LEW.DAT y
.
title Spectrum
y1label Spectral Power
x1label Frequency (cycles per observation)
y1label displacement 16
frame corner coordinates 20 20 90 90
.
spectrum y
.
HEIGHT 4
MOVE 99 1
JUST RIGHT
TEXT LEW.DAT
BOX 0 0 100 100
DEVICE 2 CLOSE
.
. -----DONE-----
.
system mv dppl1f.dat spectrum.ps
EXIT
